+
+2024-04-19  Iain Sandoe  <iain@sandoe.co.uk>
+
+	Backported from master:
+	2024-01-12  Iain Sandoe  <iain@sandoe.co.uk>
+
+	* objc-next-runtime-abi-02.cc
+	(build_v2_objc_method_fixup_call): Early exit for cases
